('q_bece_eng_2024_36', 'topic_bece_composition', 'subj_bece_english', 'A formal letter should end with:', 'multiple_choice', '["A. Love always", "B. Yours faithfully", "C. XOXO", "D. Bye bye"]', 'B', '"Yours faithfully" is the appropriate closing for formal letters.', 'easy', 1, 60),
('q_bece_eng_2024_37', 'topic_bece_composition', 'subj_bece_english', 'Which is NOT a part of a friendly letter?', 'multiple_choice', '["A. Greeting", "B. Body", "C. Subject line", "D. Closing"]', 'C', 'Subject lines are used in formal letters and emails, not friendly letters.', 'easy', 1, 60),
('q_bece_eng_2024_38', 'topic_bece_composition', 'subj_bece_english', 'A narrative essay is:', 'multiple_choice', '["A. a list of facts", "B. a story about an event", "C. a scientific report", "D. a debate"]', 'B', 'Narrative essays tell a story about a real or imagined event.', 'easy', 1, 60),
('q_bece_eng_2024_39', 'topic_bece_composition', 'subj_bece_english', 'The first paragraph of an essay is called the:', 'multiple_choice', '["A. body", "B. conclusion", "C. introduction", "D. summary"]', 'C', 'The introduction is the opening paragraph that introduces the topic.', 'easy', 1, 60),
